.DS_Store

# ── 原始設計大檔不上傳 GitHub ──
# 網站只使用轉檔後的 web 版；原始檔留在本機。
# 要更換或新增內容：把原始檔放進 public/assets/images/project/ 對應資料夾，請 Claude 轉檔即可。
public/assets/images/project/*
!public/assets/images/project/UIUX
public/assets/images/project/UIUX/*
!public/assets/images/project/UIUX/web
!public/assets/images/project/UIUX/covers
